-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",267,{
[8513]="70030EA5\n1\tDeliver the punctured shields to a task board in Rohan\030Collect punctured shields (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire punctured shields.\n",
[8514]="7004B97A\n1\tRepresentatives from each of the Allegiances can be found at Cirith Gorgor, just inside the ruins of the Black Gate.\t\n2\tTalk to King Éomer at the Udûn Foothold\tKing Éomer can be found at the Foothold, just inside Udûn.\n",
[8515]="7000876D\n1\tDefeat Frostfell Fell-talon (total: 5)\030Defeat Frostfell Earth-mover (total: 5)\tCave-claws can be found in the Isendeep mine. Bok begged you to help defend the goblins in the mines.\n2\tSpeak with Bok in Grothum\tBok awaits your return at Grothum. You slaughtered the cave-claws you encountered to defend the pathetic goblins. You should return to Bok with the news.\n",
[8516]="7004544F\n1\tGather rocks from Nardol Quarry (total: 10)\tNardol Quarry is located in south-western Taur Drúadan. You should gather rocks from Nardol Quarry.\n2\tBring the rocks to Ghân-buri-Ghân\tGhân-buri-Ghân can be found in Drû Bhûta. You should bring the rocks to Ghân-buri-Ghân.\n3\tRepair the Púkel-man statue\tThe special Púkel-man statue can be found in the Drúadan Forest, north-west of Drû Bhûta. You should repair the special Púkel-men statue.\n4\tCompleted\tYou have repaired the Púkel-man statue.\n",
[8517]="7002F83E\n1\tCollect Clotbur (total: 3)\030Collect Meadow-maid (total: 3)\030Collect Lamb's Ear (total: 3)\tThe plants desired by Elfwyn can be found growing in the Norcrofts in the areas outside the town of Elthengels. Elfwyn has asked you to collect various plantlife, so that he may use them to treat any serious wounds that may occur to people in Elthengels.\n2\tReturn to Elfwyn with the herbs\tElfwyn, the healer, may be found at his home in Elthengels. Elfwyn is awaiting your return with the various plants he has asked you to collect.\n",
[8518]="7004CF86\n1\tCollect phials (total: 10)\tYou should collect phials of root-healing draught from within Felegoth.\n2\tDefeat corrupted roots (total: 10)\030Give water to trees in need (quantity: see journal)\tYou should defeat corrupted roots and give water to trees in need throughout Eryn Lasgalen.\n3\tReturn to Radagast\tYou should return to Radagast, who can be found at the tree nursery just outside of Felegoth.\n",
[8519]="7006B7E0\n1\tCollect a sack of coal and bring it to Aranbir\tAranbir has asked you to go to the crafter's wharf in Iridír and bring him a sack of coal that can be found near the oven.\n2\tTalk to Aranbir\tYou have brought Aranbir the sack of coal for which he asked. You should talk to him to learn of your next task.\n3\tBring a tub of water to Aranbir\tAranbir has asked you to go to the fishing dock in Iridír, find a tub of water, and return with it in hand.\n4\tTalk to Aranbir\tYou have brought Aranbir the tub of water for which he asked. You should talk to him to learn of your next task.\n5\tTalk to Endunâm\tAranbir has sent you on one last errand for him - to pick up his lunch. You should talk to Endunâm the cook on the crafter's wharf in Iridír.\n6\tBring Aranbir his lunch\tYou have gotten lunch from Endunâm. You should bring it to Aranbir.\n",
[8520]="7002822F\n1\tCollect Hormgrat's tooth\tHormgrat can be found at the Hound's Rest to the east of Avardin. Cadvan asked you to get him a tooth from the most powerful Warg on the rock to the east.\n2\tBring Hormgrat's tooth to Cadvan\tCadvan is in Avardin in the central Starkmoor. Cadvan will be eager to place the Warg's tooth into the necklace.\n",
[8521]="70028232\n1\tCollect stones (total: 8)\tStones can be found around the Warg-rock to the east of Avardin. Eva asked you to collect rocks from around the Warg-rock so she can build an enclosure for cattle.\n2\tBring the stones to Eva\tEva is in Avardin, in the central Starkmoor. Eva will be eager to use the stones you found to begin building an enclosure.\n",
[8522]="7002822D\n1\tDefeat Wargs at the Hound's Rest (total: 8)\tWargs can be found to the east of Avardin in the Starkmoor. You should go to Hound's Rest and defeat Wargs.\n2\tTalk to Folant in Avardin\tFolant is in Avardin in the central Starkmoor. Folant will be pleased to hear that the Warg-population has been thinned.\n",
[8523]="70028230\n1\tCollect cattle-tags (total: 4)\tTags can be found on dead cattle around the rock to the east of Avardin. Hevina asked you to collect tags off the dead cattle around the Warg-rock.\n2\tReturn the cattle-tags to Hevina in Avardin\tHevina is in Avardin in the central Starkmoor. Hevina will be pleased to get her cattle tags back.\n",
[8524]="700006E8\n1\tDefeat Huorns (total: 7)\030Defeat bog-prowlers (total: 15)\tHuorns and bog-lurkers can be found in the north-west of Agamaur. The bark you brought Radagast revealed that the corruption in the swamp has gone too deep, and there is no hope to reclaim Agamaur or its creatures. Radagast has laid the task of bringing a merciful end to the Huorns and bog-lurkers which dwell there.\n2\tTalk to Radagast the Brown\tRadagast is at the Eglain camp in the southern reaches of Agamaur. Radagast, not without difficulty, instructed you to destroy the Huorns and bog-lurkers of Agamaur, which you have done. You should bring word of your success to the Wizard at once.\n",
[8525]="70044D64\n1\tEnter Merethrond\tMerethrond is located near the Citadel. You should seek out the feast-hall.\n2\tSpeak with Beregond\tBeregond can be found in Merethrond, near the Citadel. You should speak to Beregond.\n3\tCollect empty plates (total: 8)\tMerethrond can be found near the Citadel. You should collect empty plates to bring to the kitchen staff.\n4\tBring the plates to the kitchen staff\tThe kitchen staff can be found on the lowest level of Merethrond. You should take the plates to the kitchen staff.\n5\tShow how you defeat enemies (total: 2)\tThe kitchen staff can be found in the lowest level of Merethrond. You should show off your style of fighting for the kitchen staff.\n6\tSpeak with Beregond\tBeregond can be found in Merethrond, near the Citadel. You should speak to Beregond.\n",
[8526]="70007805\n1\tBring Himloc's letter to Constable Bolger\tConstable Bolger lives to the south-east of Staddle, on the outskirts of the town. Himloc Grouse has asked you to take a letter to Constable Bolger communicating his concerns about the Blackwolds.\n",
[8527]="70022D6E\n1\tTalk to Daervunn in Esteldín\tEsteldín lay in the bosom of the hills on the far area of the North Downs called Kingsfell. You are to seek out the Ranger there named Daervunn. You should find Daervunn in Esteldín and speak with him.\n",
[8528]="70037C09\n1\tFind Athelbald\tAthelbald is hunting boar-meat in the woods to the east of the Folde Farm. Witgil asked you to find Athelbald and see to it that he returns safely to the Folde Farm.\n2\tTalk to Athelbald\tAthelbald is hunting boar-meat in the woods to the east of the Folde Farm. Witgil asked you to find Athelbald and see to it that he returns safely to the Folde Farm.\n",
[8529]="70007951\n1\tTalk to Taylor Green\tTell Taylor Green at the Lumber Mill in Combe that Builder Earur needs more wood in Archet. Builder Earur mentioned that Archet would need more wood to completely rebuild. He asked you to visit the Combe Lumber Yard and tell Taylor Green that Archet needs more wood.\n",
[8530]="7002D404\n1\tTalk to Listein at the entrance to Zirakzigil\tListein can be found at the Door to the Clouds, the entrance to Zirakzigil in Durin's Way. Líkmund has asked you to take a message to Listein that may contain information on the location of a lost artifact in Moria.\n",
[8531]="7005B1F7\n1\tCollect enemy correspondence (total: 5)\tThe bat-riders in Vatug-ronk seem to be carrying important correspondence between captains in Gorgar's army. You should defeat bat-riders in the area to intercept their messages.\n2\tTalk to Féli in Aslíf\tYou have collected a sizeable amount of enemy correspondence. Féli will know what to do with your findings. He can be found in Aslíf on the upper tier of Deepscrave.\n",
[8532]="7002720E\n1\tTalk to Rhonwen in Barnavon\030Talk to Nesta in Barnavon\030Talk to Usbail in Barnavon\030Talk to Vevinn in Barnavon\030Talk to Tafin in Barnavon\tUsbail, Vevinn, Tafin, Rhonwen, and Nesta may be found at their homes within Lower Barnavon, far to the west of the Barnavon Mine. Gwilum has asked you to take news of the once-missing miners to their families.\n2\tTalk to Gwilum in Barnavon\tGwilum is outside the gate to Barnavon-town. You should return to Gwilum and let him know that you have done as he requested.\n",
[8533]="7006F087\n1\tDeliver letter to Concerned Husband\030Deliver letter to Concerned Wife\tBâdarul has requested that you assist in delivering letters explaining their loss to the families of soldiers who have fallen in battle here in Iridír.\n2\tReturn to Bâdarul in Iridír\tReturn to Bâdarul in Iridír and let him know that you have given the letters to the grieving families.\n",
[8534]="70037BBA\n1\tFind a messenger\tA messenger of the White Hand can be found among the perimeter forces outside of Brockbridge or on the road beyond it. Herefara has asked you to intercept one of the White Hand messengers and learn what you may about their support.\n2\tBring the map to Herefara\tReturn the map to Herefara in Brockbridge.\n",
[8535]="700359A6\n1\tForge a multi-purpose toolkit for the people of Wildermore (quantity: see journal)\tHildelith has given you a recipe for a multi-purpose toolkit. You should forge a multi-purpose toolkit for the refugees who hope to start rebuilding Wildermore.\n2\tDeliver the multi-purpose toolkit to Hildelith\tHildelith is in Forlaw. You have crafted a multi-purpose toolkit, and should now deliver it to Hildelith.\n",
[8536]="70021D8D\n1\tDefeat Shadow-wolves (total: 10)\tAt night, Shadow-wolves can be found throughout the region, but during the light of day they seem to lair in and around the Black Dens only. Amarion has asked you to defeat several of the Shadow-wolves that stalk Fordirith.\n2\tTalk to Amarion at Echad Dagoras\tAmarion is at Echad Dagoras, north-west of the Black Dens. You should bring news of your success to Amarion.\n",
[8537]="700159DD\n1\tBring an infused adamant to Perimbant\tPerimbant has asked you to bring him an infused adamant to imbue the quality you desire upon your weapon. He does not, however, know where you might find such a stone.\n2\tTalk to Perimbant to travel to the Dunlending-camp\tPerimbant can be found at Echad Dúnann, west of the gates of Moria. Perimbant has bidden you to speak with him when you are ready to depart for the Dunlending-camp, where you will conduct a midnight raid against the soldiers encamped there.\n3\tBring the empowered adamant to Perimbant\tPerimbant can be found Echad Eregion, west of the gates of Moria. You should return to Perimbant to complete the enhancement of your weapon.\n",
[8538]="7000EEDA\n1\tTalk to Mika\tMika is at Norsu-hauta, south of Zigilgund. Sigrík has asked you to speak with the young näkijä Mika about the markings on the mammoth tusk you collected for him.\n",
[8539]="700449E4\n1\tTalk to Rock\tBy completing this quest, you will receive a Minas Tirith endgame allowance.\n",
[8540]="70044511\n1\tDeliver the clipped ears to a collection box\030Collect clipped ears (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire clipped ears.\n",
[8541]="7004450F\n1\tDeliver the damaged claws to a collection box\030Collect damaged claws (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire damaged claws.\n",
[8542]="70044514\n1\tDeliver the pitted sword sheaths to a collection box\030Collect pitted sword sheaths (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire pitted sword sheaths.\n",
[8543]="70044513\n1\tDeliver the shining carapaces to a collection box\030Collect shining carapaces (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire shining carapaces.\n",
[8544]="70044510\n1\tDeliver the thickened goo to a collection box\030Collect thickened goo (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire thickened goo.\n",
